Wiring ESP32 to Winbond Chip
Winbond 25Q64FV	Function	Connect to ESP32
Pin 1 - /CS	Chip Select to ESP32	GPIO 5
Pin 2 - DO	MISO to ESP32	GPIO 19
Pin 3 - /WP	Write Protect	3.3V
Pin 4 - GND	Ground	GND
Pin 5 - DI	MOSI	to ESP32 GPIO 23
Pin 6 - CLK	Clock	to ESP32 GPIO 18
Pin 7 - /HOLD	Hold	3.3V
Pin 8 - VCC	Power (3.3V)	3.3V
